# report a fault

bugs, questions and patches: the issue tracker.

=> https://forgejo.unseenservant.dev/unseen-servant/unseen-servant/issues issues (forgejo)
=> https://github.com/OrcVole/unseen-servant/issues issues (github mirror)

vulnerabilities: not the issue tracker. the disclosure process and contact are in the security policy:

=> https://forgejo.unseenservant.dev/unseen-servant/unseen-servant/src/branch/main/SECURITY.md reporting a vulnerability (security policy)

if you try usv and it breaks, that report is wanted, not tolerated. a first release earns its second one from exactly these.

=> fix.gmi first: the symptom list, which may be faster
=> index.gmi back to the plate
